# Self-test output artifacts that embed machine-local absolute paths.
# threads-build.py --self-test rewrites these on every run with the paths of
# whatever machine ran it; committing any version would pin one machine's
# filesystem into the repo. The directory itself stays (tracked .gitkeep).
fixtures/_selftest/threads/THREADS.md
fixtures/_selftest/threads/threads.jsonl
fixtures/_selftest/threads/MAP-HISTORY.md
fixtures/_selftest/plans/
